      "type": "maintainer",
      "title": "@JsonView bypassed for @JsonUnwrapped container properties on deserialization: a Setter/Field-backed property annotated @JsonView(PrivilegedView)+@JsonUnwrapped is populated from JSON under a less-privileged active view (mass-assignment / privilege escalation). Incomplete fix of #5971 (creator path)",
      "url": "https://github.com/FasterXML/jackson-databind/security/advisories/GHSA-5gvw-p9qm-jgwh",
